                1oo% AD_CPS v1.0a (c) by Adolescent/100%
                ----------------------------------------


INTRO
-----

This is a cool <G> CPS Rater for CNet/3.  It might work on other CNet/? BBS
but, I am not about to find out.  This archive is freely distibutable,  but
its contents are _NOT_ Public Domain.   Please do not modify this file, the
rexx file, or any file in the archive in any way without my prior consent.


DISCLAIMER
----------

I do not take any responsibility for any damage this program might cause to
your bbs, your health, and/or your sexlife.  USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.


FEATURES
--------  

- Cool DIGITAL numbers.  (thanks to whomever made these for /X)
- Saves high scores for 2400,4800,9600,14400,16800,19200,21600,26400,28800,
  31200 and 33400 baud rates.  
- Configurable messages.
- Built in maintenence.
- Very compact.
- Uses CNet's CPS so the CPS is NEVER wrong!  (doesn't display CPS twice!)


INSTALLATION
------------

1.  Copy the file SYS.CPS to your SYSTEXT: dir.
2.  Copy the file AD_CPS.REXX to wherever you want it.
3.  Edit the start of the AD_CPS.REXX file to suit your BBS's needs.
4.  Change line 576 in your BBSTEXT to read...

    #0PFILES:AD_CPS.REXX %d}n1
    ^
    `-- this is CTRL-Q. (make the path wherever you put the thing!)

5.  Reload your BBSTEXT/MENU.
6.  Download something over 100k to find out if it works...

optional: (but recommended!)

7.  Setup a BBS EVENT to run the program with the arg. of M once a month or
    so to reset all the high scores.


NOTES
-----

Hmm, been testing almost the same thing at Ill Communication for about five
months with no problems.  Just decided to spruce it up and release it 1oo%!

